<title>ESTONIA: BALTIKA MAKES 5.4 MLN EEK IN 5 MONTHS.</title>
<headline>BALTIKA MAKES 5.4 MLN EEK IN 5 MONTHS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Baltika, a clothing maker and retailer, said on Wednesday that its net profit for the first five months of 1997 was 5.4 million kroons.  </p>
<p>The company said in a statement that its net turnover for the first five months was 94.9 million kroons, an increase of 14 percent compared to 1996 and its operating profit was 7.2 million kroons in the same period.</p>
<p>The company said that compared to the previous year sales grew in the Baltic states and in Ukraine.</p>
<p>-- David Mardiste, Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202/1 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
